  "bodyHash": "af12363ce317ecd2",
  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組能夠以 3D 形式渲染玩家與實體所裝備的盔甲、鞘翅與<del>鞍具</del>，並與大多數標準盔甲模組、染色及盔甲修飾相容，同時支援 16x 資源包。</p>\n<p>本專案仍處於 Beta 測試階段，因此可能會出現少量視覺瑕疵。儘管已採取多項措施以防止幀率下降，但在擁有大量穿戴盔甲實體的區域中，效能仍可能降低。這是因為動態盔甲模型能確保與所有盔甲相容，但即使使用優化模組，仍會帶來輕微的效能損耗。</p>\n<p>🔗&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/armor-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基岩版也可使用</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🟠 預計功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>3D 馬鞍（支援模組／資源包）</li>\n<li>3D 災厄獸鞍具（支援模組／資源包）</li>\n<li>3D 狼盔甲（支援模組／資源包）</li>\n<li>3D 馬盔甲（支援模組／資源包）</li>\n<li>3D 鸚鵡螺盔甲（支援模組／資源包）</li>\n<li>更佳效能優化</li>\n<li>支援 32x 資源包</li>\n<li>與 Curios API 相容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔵 依賴項目</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>（2.4 版以上）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🟢 相容性</h2>\n<p>⚠️ 可運作，但效果未如預期。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D Skin Layers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>（含所有擴充套件）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftras-fresh-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Player</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model</a></li>\n<li>⚠️&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/show-me-your-skin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Show Me Your Skin!</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-physics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Physics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a>&nbsp;（手套與吊飾）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>&nbsp;（護手）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illagers-wear-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illagers Wear Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-paper-doll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paper Doll</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-npc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy NPC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Straw Statues</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔴 不相容項目</h2>\n<p>任何新增額外盔甲圖層的模組目前皆不相容。3D 鞘翅與災厄獸鞍具在需要自訂模型的動畫材質包（如 Fresh Animations 與 Fresh Moves）上將會失效。未來將發布修復更新！</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/i-see-my-armored-hand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">I See My Armored Hand</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-armor-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Armor Layer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/female-gender\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Female Gender Mod</a></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
